# Extra egress allowlist for the Rocket.Chat monorepo, merged into the firewall's
# list for workspaces on this profile. Hostnames or CIDRs, `#` comments.
# Takes effect on a container restart — no rebuild. See ../../allowed-domains.

# --- The shared MongoDB -------------------------------------------------------
# It sits on its own docker network, which the firewall's automatic host-network
# rule does NOT cover: that one is derived from the default route, i.e. this
# container's own bridge. Pinned to this CIDR in
# containers/local-mongo/docker-compose.yml; keep the two in sync. Without it
# every connection to mongo:27017 is REJECTed and the server never boots.
172.31.0.0/24

